Feature: Source-backed management and insider research
  Scenario: Discover and safely install the management skill
    Given bundled investment research skills
    When insider skills are installed for both agents
    Then the new method and authoritative contract are available
    And existing customized skills remain untouched

  Scenario: Distinguish historical executives from entity shareholders
    Given a fictional insider package with sourced people
    When management research is accepted and summarized
    Then historical tenure and entity ownership remain distinguishable

  Scenario: A common name cannot establish reporting-owner identity
    Given a transaction without a verified owner CIK
    When insider validation rejects the package
    Then no selected database exists

  Scenario: Distinguish purchases exercises grants withholding gifts and other codes
    Given a fictional insider package with sourced people
    When management activity is accepted and inspected
    Then each original SEC code retains its economic category
    And option exercises grants and withholding never inflate purchases
    And missing trading-plan disclosure remains unknown

  Scenario: Corrected and duplicate transactions are counted once
    Given a fictional insider package with sourced people
    When management activity is accepted and inspected
    Then only the corrected sale contributes 120 shares
    And original duplicate and unresolved rows retain exclusion reasons

  Scenario: Ownership observations are never additive balances
    Given a fictional insider package with sourced people
    When accepted ownership is inspected
    Then both dated observations remain visible and latest holdings are 125

  Scenario: Proxy equity awards are not cash payments
    Given a fictional insider package with sourced people
    When management research is accepted and summarized
    Then grant-date values retain their basis and reported totals remain separate

  Scenario: Validate and preview without creating a ledger
    Given a fictional insider package with sourced people
    When insider research is validated and previewed
    Then preview declares research-only mutation without writes

  Scenario: Reordered equivalent packages are idempotent and corrections immutable
    Given an accepted fictional insider package
    When equivalent research is accepted in another order
    Then its existing immutable run is reused
    And corrected evidence creates a separate run

  Scenario: Unrelated issuer evidence is rejected atomically
    Given an accepted fictional insider package
    When another package cites a different filing issuer
    Then its import fails without changing the ledger

  Scenario: Insider research leaves financial planning inputs unchanged
    Given an initialized financial ledger
    When insider research is accepted
    Then household state and planning state remain unchanged

  Scenario: Insider reads and discovery do not initialize storage
    Given a fictional insider package with sourced people
    When unavailable research is inspected
    Then unknown runs and people are rejected without creating a ledger

  Scenario: Undocumented future tenure cannot become reported history
    Given an ordinary proxy asserts tenure after the research cutoff
    When the future tenure is validated
    Then the unsupported dates are rejected without storage

  Scenario: Vesting conditions remain terms rather than annual pay
    Given vesting terms contain an annual compensation amount
    When the compensation terms are validated
    Then the invented quantified terms are rejected without storage
